      "rendered": "<p><noscript><img data-recalc-dims=\"1\" decoding=\"async\" data-attachment-id=\"2060\" data-permalink=\"https://3dtextures.me/2016/05/16/grass-002/material_330/\" data-orig-file=\"https://i0.wp.com/3dtextures.me/wp-content/uploads/2016/05/material_330.png?fit=600%2C800&amp;ssl=1\" data-orig-size=\"600,800\" data-comments-opened=\"1\" data-image-title=\"Material_330\" data-image-description data-image-caption data-large-file=\"https://i0.wp.com/3dtextures.me/wp-content/uploads/2016/05/material_330.png?fit=600%2C800&amp;ssl=1\" class=\"alignnone size-full wp-image-2060\" src=\"https://i0.wp.com/3dtextures.me/wp-content/uploads/2016/05/material_330.png?resize=600%2C800&#038;ssl=1\" alt=\"Material_330\" width=\"600\" height=\"800\"></noscript><img decoding=\"async\" data-attachment-id=\"2060\" data-permalink=\"https://3dtextures.me/2016/05/16/grass-002/material_330/\" data-orig-file=\"https://i0.wp.com/3dtextures.me/wp-content/uploads/2016/05/material_330.png?fit=600%2C800&amp;ssl=1\" data-orig-size=\"600,800\" data-comments-opened=\"1\" data-image-title=\"Material_330\" data-image-description data-image-caption data-large-file=\"https://i0.wp.com/3dtextures.me/wp-content/uploads/2016/05/material_330.png?fit=600%2C800&amp;ssl=1\" class=\"alignnone size-full wp-image-2060 lazyload\" src=\"data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg%20xmlns%3D%22http%3A%2F%2Fwww.w3.org%2F2000%2Fsvg%22%20viewBox%3D%220%200%20600%20800%22%3E%3C%2Fsvg%3E\" alt=\"Material_330\" width=\"600\" height=\"800\" data-src=\"https://3dtextures.me/wp-content/uploads/2016/05/material_330.png\"></p>\n<p>Seamless texture, 2048&nbsp;x 2048, with the following maps:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Diffuse</li>\n<li>Normal</li>\n<li>Displacement</li>\n<li>Specularity</li>\n<li>Ambient Occlusion</li>\n</ul>\n<p><a href=\"https://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1Yov1GSt3egzsY9ttQ7bhoR4mERz6qrRd?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">DOWNLOAD ALL THE MAPS</a></p>\n<p>As always it’s a free texture, you can do whatever you want with it. Just don’t be a prick a tell it’s yours.</p>\n<p>If you like my work and you find it good enough to use on your work, consider giving me a small tip using the right&nbsp;menu and in return I’ll provide you a link to the folder where I have all my textures and you can download them all with a single click.</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://ko-fi.com/N4N259VG\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><noscript><img data-recalc-dims=\"1\" width=\"800\" decoding=\"async\" style=\"border: 0; height: 36px;\" src=\"https://i0.wp.com/az743702.vo.msecnd.net/cdn/kofi2.png?fit=800%2C36&#038;ssl=1\" alt=\"Buy Me a Coffee at ko-fi.com\" height=\"36\" border=\"0\"></noscript><img decoding=\"async\" style=\"border: 0; height: 36px;\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIAAAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAAALAAAAAABAAEAAAIBRAA7\" alt=\"Buy Me a Coffee at ko-fi.com\" height=\"36\" border=\"0\" data-src=\"https://az743702.vo.msecnd.net/cdn/kofi2.png?v=0\" class=\" lazyload\"></a></p>\n<p>Take care and be around, I’ll be posting more soon.</p>\n",
